    "regime_notes": "10d IC/ICIR: 2023-2025 -0.012495/-0.034778 (weak); 2026-2029 +0.045491/+0.164055; 2030-2035-12-19 +0.043147/+0.153558. Interpret conservatively given 15-asset cross-section and high similarity to residual-reversal family."
